==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16 seconds<sup>400f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 34.67 seconds<sup>1,040f</sup>, delay 13.33~16 seconds<sup>400f~480f</sup>.
